# HMC-2 material set: tissue mass densities [g/cm3], one per line.
#
# Each density is converted to a CT number via the Schneider et al. (2000)
# calibration and assigned the Table 6 composition of the corresponding
# HU bin. One PENELOPE .mat file is generated per density (mat1..matN).
#
# Generate with:  pixi run gen-materials
#
# density     tissue
0.02675     # air
0.112       # lung (level 1)
0.246       # lung (level 2)
0.364       # lung (level 3)
0.47995     # lung (level 4)
0.587       # lung (level 5)
0.754       # lung (level 6)
0.821       # lung (level 7)
0.926455    # adipose
0.9577225   # adipose
0.9845125   # adipose
1.0113025   # soft tissue
1.029609    # soft tissue
1.0608655   # soft tissue
1.0885      # connective tissue
1.1064      # skeletal
1.14925     # skeletal
1.20215     # skeletal
1.25505     # skeletal
1.30795     # skeletal
1.36085     # skeletal
1.41375     # skeletal
1.46665     # skeletal
